<title>UK: German trade bids for intvn grains at EU tender.</title>
<headline>German trade bids for intvn grains at EU tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German traders bid for 97,270 tonnes of rye from intervention stocks at Thursday's EU grains export tender, the state grain intervention board BLE said by telephone.</p>
<p>The tender will be adjudicated by Thursday afternoon's meeting of the EU's cereals management committee.</p>
<p>--Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
</text>
